The directory tree under:

`corpus/local/cn-replace-2026-10-18/rechunk/uploads_v2/`

contains **course PDF materials** used for midterm demo and teammate rehearsal
(about 27 PDFs / ~57 MB for four Chinese courses). These files are **not**
